{%- comment -%}
  Portal de soporte para el comerciante que compra el tema.

  Es una pagina distinta de /pages/contact: aquella atiende al comprador de la tienda y
  esta a quien configura el tema. Por eso lleva su propia plantilla y su propio formulario
  en lugar de convivir con main-contact, que era justo lo que producia dos cabeceras y dos
  formularios en la misma vista.

  El formulario es {% form 'contact' %} nativo: llega al correo del comerciante por el
  canal que Shopify ya gestiona, sin JavaScript y sin servicios de terceros.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign default_scheme_id = settings.default_color_scheme.id | default: settings.default_color_scheme | default: 'scheme-1'
  assign section_scheme = section.settings.color_scheme.id | default: section.settings.color_scheme | default: default_scheme_id
  assign card_scheme = section.settings.card_color_scheme.id | default: section.settings.card_color_scheme | default: section_scheme
  assign title_id = 'MainSupportTitle-' | append: section.id
  assign form_id = 'SupportForm-' | append: section.id
  assign name_id = 'SupportName-' | append: section.id
  assign email_id = 'SupportEmail-' | append: section.id
  assign store_id = 'SupportStore-' | append: section.id
  assign category_id = 'SupportCategory-' | append: section.id
  assign body_id = 'SupportBody-' | append: section.id
  assign errors_id = 'SupportErrors-' | append: section.id
  assign policy_count = 0
  assign faq_count = 0
  assign channel_count = 0

  for block in section.blocks
    case block.type
      when 'policy_card'
        assign policy_count = policy_count | plus: 1
      when 'support_faq'
        assign faq_count = faq_count | plus: 1
      when 'contact_channel'
        assign channel_count = channel_count | plus: 1
    endcase
  endfor
-%}

<section class="section main-support color-{{ section_scheme }}" aria-labelledby="{{ title_id }}">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="main-support__header flow">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h1 id="{{ title_id }}" class="main-support__title">{{ page.title | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
        <div class="rte lede">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.sla != blank -%}
        <p class="main-support__sla">
          <span class="main-support__sla-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {{ section.settings.sla | escape }}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if page.content != blank -%}
        <div class="rte main-support__page-content">{{ page.content }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>

    <div class="main-support__layout">
      <div class="main-support__form-column flow">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ 'support.form.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
          <h2>{{ 'support.form.title' | t }}</h2>
        </div>

        {%- form 'contact', id: form_id, class: 'support-form flow' -%}
          {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
            <p class="form-message form-message--success" role="status" tabindex="-1">
              {{- 'support.form.success' | t -}}
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if form.errors -%}
            <div class="form-message form-message--error" id="{{ errors_id }}" role="alert" tabindex="-1">
              <p>{{ 'support.form.error_heading' | t }}</p>
              {{ form.errors | default_errors }}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="support-form__grid">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="{{ name_id }}">{{ 'support.form.name' | t }}</label>
              <input
                id="{{ name_id }}"
                type="text"
                name="contact[name]"
                value="{{ form.name | default: customer.name | escape }}"
                autocomplete="name"
                aria-required="true"
                required
              >
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="{{ email_id }}">{{ 'support.form.email' | t }}</label>
              <input
                id="{{ email_id }}"
                type="email"
                name="contact[email]"
                value="{{ form.email | default: customer.email | escape }}"
                autocomplete="email"
                autocapitalize="off"
                spellcheck="false"
                aria-required="true"
                aria-invalid="{% if form.errors contains 'email' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}aria-describedby="{{ errors_id }}"{% endif %}
                required
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%}
            El campo no se repuebla tras un error de validacion: el objeto form de Shopify
            solo devuelve name, email y body, asi que un value aqui seria codigo muerto que
            aparenta una memoria que no existe.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="{{ store_id }}">{{ 'support.form.store_url' | t }}</label>
            <input
              id="{{ store_id }}"
              type="text"
              name="contact[Store URL]"
              inputmode="url"
              autocapitalize="off"
              spellcheck="false"
              placeholder="{{ 'support.form.store_url_placeholder' | t | escape }}"
              aria-describedby="SupportStoreHelp-{{ section.id }}"
            >
            <p id="SupportStoreHelp-{{ section.id }}" class="form-field__help">
              {{- 'support.form.store_url_help' | t -}}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="{{ category_id }}">{{ 'support.form.category' | t }}</label>
            <select id="{{ category_id }}" name="contact[Category]" aria-required="true" required>
              <option value="">{{ 'support.form.category_placeholder' | t }}</option>
              <option value="{{ 'support.form.category_presets' | t | escape }}">{{ 'support.form.category_presets' | t }}</option>
              <option value="{{ 'support.form.category_sections' | t | escape }}">{{ 'support.form.category_sections' | t }}</option>
              <option value="{{ 'support.form.category_issue' | t | escape }}">{{ 'support.form.category_issue' | t }}</option>
              <option value="{{ 'support.form.category_commercial' | t | escape }}">{{ 'support.form.category_commercial' | t }}</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="{{ body_id }}">{{ 'support.form.message' | t }}</label>
            <textarea
              id="{{ body_id }}"
              name="contact[body]"
              rows="6"
              maxlength="2000"
              aria-required="true"
              aria-describedby="SupportBodyHelp-{{ section.id }}"
              required
            >{{- form.body | escape -}}</textarea>
            <p id="SupportBodyHelp-{{ section.id }}" class="form-field__help">
              {{- 'support.form.message_help' | t -}}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="support-form__footer">
            <p class="form-field__help">{{ 'support.form.required_note' | t }}</p>
            <button class="button support-form__submit" type="submit">
              {{- 'support.form.submit' | t -}}
            </button>
          </div>
        {%- endform -%}
      </div>

      <aside class="main-support__aside flow">
        {%- if policy_count > 0 -%}
          <div class="main-support__policies">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.type == 'policy_card' -%}
                <article class="main-support__policy color-{{ card_scheme }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                  <h2 class="main-support__policy-title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
                  {%- if block.settings.items != blank -%}
                    <div class="rte main-support__policy-items">{{ block.settings.items }}</div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </article>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if faq_count > 0 -%}
          <div class="main-support__faq flow">
            <h2>{{ 'support.faq.title' | t }}</h2>
            <faq-accordion {% if section.settings.single_open_faq %}data-single-open{% endif %}>
              {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                {%- if block.type == 'support_faq' -%}
                  {% render 'faq-entry', block: block %}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </faq-accordion>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if channel_count > 0 -%}
          <div class="main-support__channels flow">
            <h2>{{ 'support.channels.title' | t }}</h2>
            <ul class="main-support__channel-list unstyled-list">
              {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                {%- if block.type == 'contact_channel' -%}
                  <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
                      <a class="main-support__channel" href="{{ block.settings.link }}">
                        <span>
                          <strong>{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</strong>
                          {%- if block.settings.detail != blank -%}
                            <small>{{ block.settings.detail | escape }}</small>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </span>
                        {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow', size: 18 %}
                      </a>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <div class="main-support__channel">
                        <span>
                          <strong>{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</strong>
                          {%- if block.settings.detail != blank -%}
                            <small>{{ block.settings.detail | escape }}</small>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </span>
                      </div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.main_support.name",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.all.color_scheme.label",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:sections.all.eyebrow.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "t:sections.all.intro.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sla",
      "label": "t:sections.main_support.settings.sla.label",
      "info": "t:sections.main_support.settings.sla.info",
      "default": "Average response time: under 24 business hours"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "single_open_faq",
      "label": "t:sections.main_support.settings.single_open_faq.label",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "card_color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.main_support.settings.card_color_scheme.label",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "policy_card",
      "name": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.policy_card.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "t:sections.all.heading.label",
          "default": "What is covered"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "items",
          "label": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.policy_card.settings.items.label",
          "info": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.policy_card.settings.items.info",
          "default": "<ul><li>Theme settings, sections and preset setup.</li><li>Bugs caused by the theme code.</li><li>Theme updates and fixes.</li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "support_faq",
      "name": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.support_faq.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "question",
          "label": "t:sections.main_faq.blocks.faq_item.settings.question.label",
          "default": "How do I switch between presets?"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "t:sections.main_faq.blocks.faq_item.settings.answer.label",
          "default": "<p>Open the theme editor, go to theme settings and pick a preset at the top of the panel.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "open_by_default",
          "label": "t:sections.main_faq.blocks.faq_item.settings.open_by_default.label",
          "default": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "contact_channel",
      "name": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.contact_channel.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "t:sections.all.heading.label",
          "default": "Studio hours"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "detail",
          "label": "t:sections.main_support.blocks.contact_channel.settings.detail.label",
          "default": "Monday to Friday"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "t:sections.all.link.label",
          "info": "t:sections.all.link_destination_info"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.main_support.presets.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
